पौरव + .{@-वः@}
—1 A descendant of Puru; Ś. 5. 2 N. of a country or people in the north of India.
—2 An inhabitant or ruler of that country.

पौराणिक + .{@-कः@}
—1 A Brāhmaṇa well-versed in the Purāṇas, a public reader of the Purāṇas.
—2 A mythologist.
